#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1.2 Your goal {#12-your-goal}"
msgstr "1.2 Ang iyong layunin {#12-your-goal}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Build a GHZ circuit for 20 qubits or more so that, upon measurement, **the fidelity of your GHZ state > 0.5.**\n"
"Note:\n"
"- You need to use an Eagle device (`min_num_qubits=127`) and set the shots number as 40,000.\n"
"- You should execute the GHZ circuit using the `execute_ghz_fidelity` function, and calculate the fidelity using the `check_ghz_fidelity_from_jobs` function.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bumuo ng GHZ circuit para sa 20 qubit o higit pa upang, sa pagsukat, **ang fidelity ng iyong GHZ state ay > 0.5.**\n"
"Tandaan:\n"
"- Kailangan mong gumamit ng Eagle device (`min_num_qubits=127`) at itakda ang bilang ng shots bilang 40,000.\n"
"- Dapat mong patakbuhin ang GHZ circuit gamit ang function na `execute_ghz_fidelity`, at kalkulahin ang fidelity gamit ang function na `check_ghz_fidelity_from_jobs`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is intended as an independent exercise, in which you leverage what you "
"have learned so far in this course.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ito ay inilaan bilang isang independiyenteng ehersisyo, kung saan gagamitin "
"mo ang natutunan mo sa kursong ito hanggang ngayon.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this notebook, we will apply three strategies to creating good GHZ states"
" using 16 qubits and 30 qubits. These approaches build on strategies you "
"already know from previous lessons.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa notebook na ito, maglalapat tayo ng tatlong estratehiya sa paglikha ng "
"magagandang GHZ state gamit ang 16 na qubit at 30 na qubit. Ang mga "
"diskarteng ito ay nakabatay sa mga estratehiyang alam mo na mula sa mga "
"nakaraang aralin.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. Strategy 1. Noise-aware qubit selection {#2-strategy-1-noise-aware-qubit-"
"selection}"
msgstr ""
"2. Estratehiya 1. Noise-aware na pagpili ng qubit {#2-strategy-1-noise-"
"aware-qubit-selection}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We first specify a backend. Because we will be working extensively with the "
"properties of a specific backend, it is a good idea to specify one backend, "
"as opposed to using the ```least_busy``` option.\n"
msgstr ""
"Una, tutukuyin natin ang isang backend. Dahil malawak tayong magtatrabaho sa"
" mga katangian ng isang partikular na backend, mainam na tukuyin ang isang "
"backend, kumpara sa paggamit ng opsyong ```least_busy```.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We are going to build a circuit involving many two-qubit gates. It makes "
"sense for us to use the qubits that have the lowest errors when implementing"
" those two-qubit gates. Finding the best \"qubit chain\" based on the "
"reported 2q-gate errors is a nontrivial problem. But we can define a few "
"functions to help us determine the best qubits to use.\n"
msgstr ""
"Magtatayo tayo ng circuit na may maraming two-qubit gate. Makatuwirang "
"gumamit ng mga qubit na may pinakamababang error kapag isinasagawa ang mga "
"two-qubit gate na iyon. Ang paghanap ng pinakamahusay na \"qubit chain\" "
"batay sa mga iniulat na 2q-gate error ay isang hindi simpleng problema. "
"Ngunit maaari tayong mag-define ng ilang function upang matulungan tayong "
"matukoy kung aling mga qubit ang pinakamainam gamitin.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We will use the functions above to find all the simple paths of N qubits "
"between all pairs of nodes in the graph (Reference: "
"[all_pairs_all_simple_paths](https://www.rustworkx.org/apiref/rustworkx.all_pairs_all_simple_paths.html#rustworkx-"
"all-pairs-all-simple-paths)).\n"
msgstr ""
"Gagamitin natin ang mga function sa itaas upang mahanap ang lahat ng "
"simpleng landas na may N qubit sa pagitan ng lahat ng pares ng node sa graph"
" (Sanggunian: "
"[all_pairs_all_simple_paths](https://www.rustworkx.org/apiref/rustworkx.all_pairs_all_simple_paths.html#rustworkx-"
"all-pairs-all-simple-paths)).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Then, using the `path_fidelity` function created above, we will find the "
"best qubit chain which has the largest path fidelity.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos, gamit ang function na `path_fidelity` na nilikha sa itaas, "
"hahanapin natin ang pinakamahusay na qubit chain na may pinakamalaking path "
"fidelity.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let's plot the best qubit chain, shown in pink, in the coupling map "
"diagram.\n"
msgstr ""
"I-plot natin ang pinakamahusay na qubit chain, na ipinapakita sa kulay pink,"
" sa diagram ng coupling map.\n"

