# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The next idea is to find a balanced tree of qubits. Using the tree rather "
"than the chain, the circuit depth should become lower. Before that, we "
"remove nodes with \"bad\" readout errors and edges with \"bad\" gate errors "
"from the coupling graph.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang susunod na ideya ay hanapin ang isang balanced tree ng mga qubit. Sa "
"pamamagitan ng paggamit ng tree kaysa sa chain, mas mababa ang magiging "
"circuit depth. Bago iyon, inaalis natin ang mga node na may \"masamang\" "
"readout error at mga edge na may \"masamang\" gate error mula sa coupling "
"graph.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let's draw the coupling map graph without the bad edges and bad qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
